    "note": "VAT returns and payment are due within 60 days after each period (quarterly; half-yearly with net tax rates). Income tax is assessed by the canton from the return, with provisional invoices during the year and the balance on assessment; dates vary by canton, so the vault keeps the reserve until the end of the following year.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "ESTV: Mehrwertsteuer bezahlen",
